DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
9257::$$$message_0068_0000_0000$$$::I finish my lunch and walk around the school in the afternoon.[lr]::
9258::$$$message_0068_0000_0001$$$::It's a weekend, but there are figures here and there in the hallway.[lr]::
9259::$$$message_0068_0000_0002$$$::It must be the students working hard at their club activities. There's no doubt the other building where the music room or the art room is more lively.::
9260::$$$message_0068_0001_0000$$$::I look back for some reason.[lr]::
9261::$$$message_0068_0001_0001$$$::There's nothing in particular that catches my eye.[lr]::
9262::$$$message_0068_0001_0002$$$::"Hm?"[lr]::
9263::$$$message_0068_0001_0003$$$::What's strange is that there was no reason at all to look back.::
9264::$$$message_0068_0002_0000$$$::I suddenly feel like drinking tea, so I head to the student council room.[lr]::
9265::$$$message_0068_0002_0001$$$::When I peer into the classroom from the hallway, I see some students.[lr]::
9266::$$$message_0068_0002_0002$$$::The hallway isn't completely silent.[lr]::
9267::$$$message_0068_0002_0003$$$::Behind me is just quiet. As I'm walking, I hear people's voices ahead of me but...[lr]::
9268::$$$message_0068_0002_0004$$$::"..."[lr]::
9269::$$$message_0068_0002_0005$$$::The hallway when I look behind me is quiet like it exists in a different world.::
9270::$$$message_0068_0003_0000$$$::"...Why did I look behind me...?"[lr]::
9271::$$$message_0068_0003_0001$$$::There's nothing in particular that catches my eye.[lr]::
9272::$$$message_0068_0003_0002$$$::There's no reason to look behind me.[lr]::
9273::$$$message_0068_0003_0003$$$::It would make sense if I had some reason like having the chills, but just looking ambiguously behind me is eerie.::
9274::$$$message_0068_0004_0000$$$::They say that scary stories are trending, but depending on how you see it, wouldn't this be considered a scary story too?[lr]::
9275::$$$message_0068_0004_0001$$$::A mystery where things behind me bother me for no reason.::
9276::$$$message_0068_0005_0000$$$::"Well, I guess you could say this is typical for a school around this time of year."[lr]::
9277::$$$message_0068_0005_0001$$$::Exams are near, and there are a lot of students that are mentally sensitive.[lr]::
9278::$$$message_0068_0005_0002$$$::There are a lot of things to think about during these four days, and I might just be tired without realizing it.::
9279::$$$message_0068_0006_0000$$$::"...Yeah. I should just go home and rest."[lr]::
9280::$$$message_0068_0006_0001$$$::I can go to the student council room another time.[lr]::
9281::$$$message_0068_0006_0002$$$::I walk through the hallway. [seloop storage=se318.wav]I restrain myself from wanting to look back many times and leave school.::
9282::$$$message_0068_0007_0000$$$::"Wait, [wvl][shock vmax=15 time=500 count=-5]this isn't just my imagination!!!"[lr]::
9283::$$$message_0068_0007_0001$$$::Something's there.[lr]::
9284::$$$message_0068_0007_0002$$$::I can't see it, but there's something that's following me.::
9285::$$$message_0068_0008_0000$$$::"...No way. Those two aren't following me still, are they?"[lr]::
9286::$$$message_0068_0008_0001$$$::I stare closely at potential hiding spots.[lr]::
9287::$$$message_0068_0008_0002$$$::...But, there's no presence of the two of them.::
9288::$$$message_0068_0009_0000$$$::"I guess it's just my imagination. I wonder if my nerves are also becoming sensitive..."[lr]::
9289::$$$message_0068_0009_0001$$$::I shrug my shoulders.[lr]::
9290::$$$message_0068_0009_0002$$$::I should buy some grapefruit on the way home and try imitating aroma therapy or something.[lr]::
9291::$$$message_0068_0009_0003$$$::"...There!"[lr]::
9292::$$$message_0068_0009_0004$$$::I make a feint and sprint to the stairs.::
9293::$$$message_0068_0010_0000$$$::"...Mrgh."[lr]::
9294::$$$message_0068_0010_0001$$$::I feel like something familiar ran down the stairs.[lr]::
9295::$$$message_0068_0010_0002$$$::I don't have any conclusive evidence, but it's probably...[lr]::
9296::$$$message_0068_0010_0003$$$::"...But, why?"[lr]::
9297::$$$message_0068_0010_0004$$$::Its intention is uncertain, but it might be something meaningful.[lr]::
9298::$$$message_0068_0010_0005$$$::I bet I wouldn't be able to catch it even if I went out of my way to chase after it, so maybe I should leave pretending not to notice it...::

